{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13601","headline":"题弟臮述书赋後 · 窦蒙","name":"题弟臮述书赋後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受命别家乡，思归每断肠。\n季江留被在，子敬与琴亡。\n吾弟当平昔，才名荷宠光。\n作诗通小雅，献赋掩长杨。\n流转三千里，悲啼百万行。\n庭前紫荆树，何日再芬芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}